                            <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Speediance Gym Monster 2 (Basic)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,387</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Optional Wellness+; $149.99/yr on Speediance's store</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">$3,387 without it; $3,837 with three annual plans</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Speediance Gym Monster (Refurbished)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $1,999 (Amazon, 9 Nov)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Optional; $29/mo in Garage Gym Reviews' roundup</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $1,999 without it; $3,043 with 36 x $29</td></tr>
