              <tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">SQUATZ Apollo Board Mini</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $800 (Amazon, 9 Nov)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">Listing says free app</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 py-2 pr-4 text-gray-700">About $800, per the listing</td></tr>
